-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §119 קידום בדרגות: a second deputy is
-- promoted as a teacher (§38).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `38`

§ `119 קידום בדרגות`

@ref akn:art_119
GIVEN c IS A `candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a second deputy meets the conditions for the next grade` c IF
    `meets the conditions for the next grade` c
